      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Responsibility\n\n- UserPreferences\n will keep channels preferences of a user.\n\n- Notification\nwill keep notification message and metadata\n\n- NotificationChannel (Interface)\nbussiness logic to send message through a particualr channel\n\nImplementation\n1. SMS_Notification\n2. Email_Notification\n3. Push_Notification\n\n- NotificationChannelFactory\ncreate diffrence kind of notification objects\n\n- NotificationDispatcher\ndispatch user notification through multiple channels base on user preference.\n\n- NotificationService\nentry point to system, provides a method to send notification",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Responsibility\n\n- UserPreferences\n will keep channels preferences of a user.\n\n- Notification\nwill keep notification message and metadata\n\n- NotificationChannel (Interface)\nbussiness logic to send message through a particualr channel\n\nImplementation\n1. SMS_Notification\n2. Email_Notification\n3. Push_Notification\n\n- NotificationChannelFactory\ncreate diffrence kind of notification objects\n\n- NotificationDispatcher\ndispatch user notification through multiple channels base on user preference.\n\n- NotificationService\nentry point to system, provides a method to send notification",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
