      "text": "Functional Requirement\n\n1. The system should send notification\n2. System must support multiple channel to sending\nnotifiactions\n   - Email\n   - SMS\n   - PUSH\n3. User can set channel preference\n\nNon - functional requirment\n\n1. Extensible\n2. Maintainable\n3. Reliable",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n\n1. The system should send notification\n2. System must support multiple channel to sending notifiactions\n   - Email\n   - SMS\n   - PUSH\n3. User can set channel preference\n\nNon - functional requirment\n\n1. Extensible\n2. Maintainable\n3. Reliable",
      "autoResize": false,
