      "text": "Define relationships\n\n- NotificationService\nDepend on NotificationDispatcher to dispatch notification\n\n- NotificationDispatcher\nfetch user clannel preference\ndispatch notifcation to notifcation channels\nuses NotifcationChannelFactory to create diffrent channels\n\n- Preference Service\nSave user preference objects\nProvices user preference wherever needed",
